# Cursor rules — FilsPay monorepo
# Full conventions: AGENTS.md. The accepted ADRs in docs/adr/ are the rules;
# if this file disagrees with an ADR, the ADR wins.

# Money (ADR-0001)
# Integer fils everywhere: 1 BD = 1000 fils, whole fils only. No floats,
# no cents. Parse text amounts with parseBhdToFils. Monetary columns are
# BIGINT; Go uses int64.

# Settlement timing (ADR-0003)
# The business day closes at midnight Asia/Bahrain (UTC+3). Date-only
# parameters mean Bahrain midnight; `to` is exclusive.

# Security
# Every client-presentable token or code (sessions, API keys, OTPs,
# payment-link tokens, invite codes) uses node:crypto. Handlers check role
# and merchant scope themselves. Impersonation is read-only.

# Refunds
# POST /v1/refunds and the refund.succeeded webhook event are live.

# Frozen packages
# packages/money and apps/settlement/internal/money need finance sign-off.

# Tests
# Prefer new test files. A test that locks in a bug may be corrected; record
# why in BUGS.md.

# Build verification (sequentially; shared DB)
# npm test
# cd apps/settlement && go test -count=1 -p 1 ./...
